# gen7 cohort cache: deterministic and rebuilt in ~13 s by load_cohort(); checking it in
# would add 3.4 MB of derived parquet that must not be allowed to drift from the builder
# --- run artefacts ----------------------------------------------------------
# OOF prediction dumps are ~940 MB and regenerate from the committed code.  Each
# run's manifest carries their SHA-256, so a rebuild stays checkable.
runs/**/*.parquet
runs/**/*.log
runs/**/*.png
# ...except the frozen cohort. Every number from gen6 onward is defined against
# it (fingerprint bed178ec1a7a82b0, 5,248 rows / 152 extractants / 131 ECFP
# clusters / 79 chemotypes). Its build recipe is NOT sufficient on its own:
# cohort membership is weakly target-dependent, so a rebuild can differ by a
# few row ids. It is 3.3 MB. Commit it.
!runs/gen7_architecture/cache/*.parquet
